362,31-87-0001,31,87,0001,3029.0,1987-01-01,1999-03-18 13:49:10,DOROTHY ERICKSON - GEM FUEL CO.,SECOND STREET SHELL - 711 ADAMS,LA GRANDE,97850,(503)963-5221,False,1.0,,4.0,,True,False,False,,False,False,False,False,False,"*** SEQUENT LUST COMMENTS : Tanks have been pulled and property sold.  Site history still being investigated.  Priority - 61. I HAVE SENT A MODIFIED PERMIT APPLICATION TO THE KOHLERS. BACKLOG LETTER SENT ON AUGUST 18, 2005 *** (8/18/05 KJR) Back Log letter sent on 8/18/05.  UST release in 1987.  New USTs installed but no records of assessment or cleanup being performed.  Correct Address is 711 Adams.",Sunshine Motors 31-08-0213,,20032.0,0.0,KROBERT,2011-07-25 10:36:40.767
