1399,26-90-0253,26,90,0253,848.0,1990-07-17,1999-03-18 13:49:10,TEXACO STATION,519 NE BROADWAY,PORTLAND,97232,(503) 284-5050,False,8.0,POCKET,4.0,,True,False,False,,False,False,False,False,False,"Decom 5 USTs by removal in 90 and 1 UST in 98. 800 cu yds PCS taken to Hillsboro Landfill.  3 pockets of contamination remain - under NE corner of building, under active tank nest and under east end of southern dispenser.  Soil BTEX values below RBCs",,,10318.0,0.0,KDANA,2007-11-07 09:46:41.063
