4/3/2017:  2nd indoor air sample results look good for occ.  one benzene hit >urb res.  Need to see if there is a final wrap up report in pre-indoor air sampling.  If so, i can start staff memo. (RAH)

8.2016:  indoor air sampling completed in July.  Results very low.  One more event in November, thensee notes from 5.2016 if results are still good. (RAH)

5.2016:  GES proposed indoor air sampling, will be completed in 2016.  if good, move forward with cmmp, final RB closure report, including info. wrap-up since Delta RBCAP, and possibly and ees.  (RAH)

3/5/2015: New Consultant-GW and Env. Services, Melissa Blaha.  (RAH)
from 11/3/14 email:  In attempt to achieve a less restrictive closure, conduct additional sampling at SG-2 and SG-3 and sub-slab sampling in the Aloha Villa Shopping Center.  Sampling would need to be performed for probably 2 years on a quarterly basis to gain an understanding of trends and whether or not concentrations remain below the occupational screening levels.  If conditions are acceptable for commercial use, there would be no restrictions for commercial (mainly as on-grade, given the high groundwater seasonally).  If concentrations meet urban residential screening levels, there would be no restrictions for this receptor, either.  However, if they do fail for urban residential, some restriction would be necessary.-see full email in file though.

QM:  I approved suspension of QM on 8/1/2012-enough data collected, URS to submit plume maps particularly to see if enough soil data for characterization.  if so, then only additional soil gas sampling will be completed.   (RAH)

8/2014:  4 soil gas events completed. early high levels at two sg points, then concentrations came down.  urban residential use is allowed, doesn't appear res. based on zoning.  to discuss soil gas data with Henning.  

8.1/12:  URS to put together some soil plume maps to ensure characterization.  if ok, then only will submit work plan for some soil gas sampling.  maps due end of august. (RAH)

6.2012:  should get work plan this quarter from URS (RAH)

12.27.11:  URS to complete one event in 2012, then address the below 11/2011 items. (RAH)

11/2011: Picked up from Laurey in summer 2011. URS would like to complete the december event & then propose add. work Laurey wanted them to complete.  add. work includes,more borings in center of plume area, soil gas sampling, draft CMMP, revise BWUD.  also, see if there is restrictive covenant from property sale.  (RAH)


