1759,34-90-0463,34,90,0463,2256.0,1990-11-29,1999-03-18 13:49:10,SCHMIDT SANITARY SERVICE,8325 SW ROSS,TIGARD,97224,(503)639-2378,False,,MATRIX,,,True,False,False,,False,True,False,True,False,"This cleanup has been rejected, and a new cleanup number assigned",34-99-0697 and 34-07-0326,"This cleanup has been rejected based on new data, and reassigned the a file number 34-07-0326.  There is groundwater and soils contamination. The cleanup does not meet the requirements of the soil matrix rules, based on new evidence.",32533.0,0.0,RHOOD,2013-11-15 11:52:19.443
