Prior to injections want to sample and install 1 new MW.

11/2019: Installed 1 additional MW, 1st round ND.  Will do one more event.  (RAH)

12/4/18:  Proposed plan to inject H2O2 and CaO2 approved. Injections will probably occur in January 2019.  (RAH)

6/20/18:  MTBE levels still not remediated or stable.  Nee some further delineation inv. and possible treatment.  (RAH)

8/2015:  MTBE increasing.  need to discuss with antea. (RAH)

