3.29.13: discussed w/todd vanek.  will try to replace sg2 since h20 in it.  will add permanent sg point west of station building to address off-prop and down gradient sg conc.  (RAH)

2.2013:  sg inv. completed, get some more events, prob. need some sg delineation (RAH)

11.21.12:  Approved final work plan.

2.10.12:  Met with antea this week. discussed gw monitoring, and next phase of some delineation and soil gas.  approved biosparge system shut down.  (RAH)

12.20.2011:  soil removal completed in summer 2011, was approved by Laurey Cook prior to her leaving.  2 qm events completed since.  need to get some items from Todd Vanek (consultant with Antae). (RAH)

