5132,27-93-4159,27,93,4159,5667.0,1993-09-20,1999-03-18 13:49:10,Independence BP,178 MONMOUTH ST,INDEPENDENCE,97351,(503)588-0455,False,,,,,True,False,False,,False,False,False,False,False,"
