10.2013:  Approved soil gas work plan and MW abandonment. (RAH)


9/2013:  Soil gas sampling and MW abandoment to occurr this autumn. (RAH)

11.26.12:  may not get SAIC update, county looking to purchase property for road widening and then transfer it over to ODOT.  Waiting for further notice, this could happen near the first of 2013.  (RAH)

