CAP submitted, additional sampling requested.  Sampling performed in 2007 but results not submitted.  I requested raw data and received data on 7/21/2010.  High impact on neighboring property in shallow groundwater.  Soil gas sampling under service station building in 2002, showed only low benzene. However, sampled at 4 feet and groundwater at 4 to 5 at that time of year. Not sufficient to demonstrate not a threat.  LLC 7/22/2010

