7279,27-96-4004,27,96,4004,5539.0,1996-01-16,1999-03-18 13:49:10,Main Street Pizza,180 E MAIN STREET,MONMOUTH,97361,(503) 838-1695,False,1.0,,4.0,,True,False,False,,False,False,False,False,False,,,"On January 16, 1996, DEQ received notice that gasoline, heating-oil and waste-oil petroleum had leaked from underground storage tanks on this property. The contamination did extend into Knox Street but not Main Street. During the course of this site cleanup five (5) underground storage tanks were removed along with approximately 1,400 tons of petroleum contaminated soil. Shallow groundwater contamination and small areas of inaccessible petroleum contaminated soil remain at this site. These area are found under the current building, under a storage structure NW of the current building, within the eastern portion of Knox Street and within the northern portion of Main Street.  DEQ has evaluated efforts to contain, clean up, and assess the contamination at thsi site and, given the current a reasonably likely future uses, has concluded that petroleum contamination from this former leak is no longer a threat to human health or the environment.",21669.0,0.0,JGLASS,2012-10-25 11:46:41.750
