7851,20-96-7024,20,96,7024,6111.0,1996-04-24,1999-03-18 13:49:10,Franko #3,4701 W 11TH AVE,EUGENE,97402,(541)687-9200,False,7.0,MATRIX,4.0,NFA,True,False,False,,False,False,False,False,False,Site re-opened on : 4/28/2010 By Virginia Deck. Previous Final Invoice Request Date: 12/3/2003.  Site reopened to charge additional time related to enforcement and to issue NFA... J Glass.,,"Two 10,000-gallon underground storage tanks used for storing gasoline were decommissioned by removal from the property in April 1996.  Approximately 200 cubic yards of suspected petroleum contaminated soil (PCS) was excavated from the UST excavation.  The excavated soil was stockpiled, treated, sampled, and resued onsite.  Following soil removal, four confirmation soil samples were collected from the side walls of the excavation at the soil/water interface followed by groundwater sampling.  All samples were below DEQ's generic cleanuup requirements.",22072.0,0.0,GDECK,2010-11-05 17:03:46.957
