7857,17-96-0024,17,96,0024,4492.0,1996-04-30,1999-03-18 13:49:10,NORTH VALLEY TEXACO,5000 MONUMENT DR,GRANTS PASS,97526,(503) 476-9226,False,1.0,,4.0,NFA,True,False,False,,False,False,False,False,False,"*** SEQUENT LUST COMMENTS : IT APPEARS LEAKAGE IS FROM LONG AGO ***

EClough reviewed and commented on site investigation work plan (5-dec-12), also made slight adjustment to LIPS score based on report of public drinking water supply well on-site (~100ft)",,"The site is an operating service station located at 5000 Monument Drive in Grants Pass, Oregon.  In April 1996, a below-ground petroleum release was confirmed during the permanent decommissioning of five USTs.  Approximately 250 cubic yards of PCS were excavated and transported offsite for treatment using aeration techniques under an approved soil treatment plan.  Sampling confirmed the material met the treatment objectives and was subsequently used for subgrade fill beneath a parking area.  

Sample results confirmed the presence of petroleum impact in soil and groundwater beyond the accessible limits of the excavation.  

A soil and groundwater investigation conducted in January 2013 confirmed soil and groundwater impact exists beyond the excavation boundary and likely encroaches beneath Monument Drive.  No soil and groundwater contaminants were identified at concentrations exceeding applicable risk-based concentrations.  Fate and transport modeling indicates the contaminant plume moves slowly and will undergo continued attenuation.  

Water wells provide potable water to the subject property and nearby residents.  Sample results suggest the underlying aquifer is unimpacted by the release.  

DEQ determined the release has been investigated in accordance with the UST Cleanup Rules.  The magnitude and extent of remaining contaminnats has been identified and do not pose a risk to potential receptors under current or likely future exposure scenarios.  DEQ issued a No Further Action determination on December 26, 2013.",21008.0,0.0,GDECK,2014-01-09 16:51:11.247
