June 2018 Phase 2 prompted by property transaction found Gx & Dx in soil and GW samples near former UST nest, believed to be related to prior release. Site reopened to review GW contamination that was previously unreported. Need GW evaluation and additional information on drinking water well that services site and convenience store. 6/28/18 J.Claussen

