8047,03-96-0379,03,96,0379,1429.0,1996-06-25,1999-03-18 13:49:10,STEIN OIL - LUTHER DAVIS AUTO REPAIR,9391 SE 32ND AVE,MILWAUKIE,97222,(503) 653-2940,False,,MATRIX,3.0,,True,False,False,,False,True,False,False,False,,ECSI #1664,"A gasoline service station operated at the site from 1940 to 1986.  The site was subsequently leased to Luther Davis Auto Repair.  In 1994, a soil gas sample was collected near the site as part of an area-wide survey for chlorinated solvents in the Milwaukie area.  The sample identified both solvents and petroleum compounds.  Subsequent investigations identified up to 11,400 ppm gasoline and 322 ppm lead in soils at the site, and up to 100,000 ppb gasoline and 12.4 ppb trichloroethene in the groundwater.  The LUST file was Administratively Closed in May 2011 and referred to the Cleanup program for further action due to the chlorinated solvents and the site being identified as a potential brownfield.  See ECSI #1664 for more information.",40257.0,0.0,KDANA,2011-05-11 14:50:34.100
