8201,05-96-0488,05,96,0488,113.0,1996-08-20,1999-03-18 13:49:10,CITY OF RAINIER MARINA,FOOT OF E 3RD ST,RAINIER,97048,(503) 556-7301,True,4.0,GW,,,True,False,False,,False,False,False,False,False,"A 1,000-gallon gasoline UST was removed from the site in August 1996, along with approx 6 cubic yards of PCS.  Three shallow GW monitoring wells were installed, and two were impacted.  From 2000-2001, nine soil borings were advanced and a 4th monitoring well installed to determine the extent of contamination.  Quarterly GW monitoring was conducted in 2001, and the contractor concluded there were no complete exposure pathways.  DEQ responded in July 2002 that additional info was needed, particularly an ecological risk assessment for the nearby (<100 ft) Columbia River.  The City of Rainier reported they had no money to conduct additional work, however.  (6/22/09 KPD)",,,17988.0,0.0,KDANA,2009-06-22 08:38:36.833
