9438,26-97-0520,26,97,0520,,1997-07-02,1999-03-18 13:49:10,Mobil Station 10-LVL (Former),2407 SW 5TH AVE # 2419,PORTLAND,97201,(503) 226-6500,False,4.0,GW,,,False,False,True,,False,False,False,False,False,"6.2020: site was originally called in as 2405 SW 5th.  I updated address to meet portlandmaps.2407 (RAH)

9.2.2016:  No call back from Cardno ERI, so i backlogged file (RAH)

5.2016:  No project movement.  followed up with cardno and Peter Surrerier re: status. (RAH)

2/2015: new ownership as of 6/2014-Pacific skyline holdings.  checking on status.  we were going to see if they would conduct deeper sg sampling or be ok with ees for deeper construction.  sg acceptable from shallow.  (RAH)

10.16.2012:  Replied to Amar voice message last week with email that I still needed a reply from him on my comments dated 21 March (He wanted to know the status or how to move forward).  

3/2012:  Replied to ERI on work plan and file review.  CAP from 2005 was never commented on.  Need to fill in some gaps.  see my reply to ERI via email dated 21 March. (RAH)

12.20.11:  followed up w/CardnoERI re: setting up a meeting re: the below work plan.  Asked that we have the meeting in January 2012.  (RAH)

3.28.2011:  ERI preparing soil gas and confirmation soil sampling work plan.  They hope to get it to Exxon next week for their review prior to submittal to me.  (RAH)


A Mobil service station was built at this site in 1971 and torn down in 1981.  Sampling in 1997 and 1999 found petroleum contamination in the soil and groundwater.  Four groundwater monitoring wells were installed in December 2001.  Six boreholes were drilled in September 2004 and incorporated into a soil vapor extraction system, which began operating in March 2006.  The groundwater contamination cleared up in 2009, and four consecutive ""clean"" quarters were achieved.  Groundwater monitoring ended in July 2010.  Monthly SVE monitoring is apparently on-going.  Confirmation soil sampling and a Risk-Based Closure report are still needed.  (10/28/10 KPD)",,,28625.0,0.0,RHOOD,2020-09-11 14:27:06.413
