10345,26-98-0144,26,98,0144,5081.0,1998-03-02,1999-03-18 13:49:10,BUS BARN,20311 NE GLISAN ST,FAIRVIEW,97024,(503) 661-7200,False,4.0,GW,,,True,False,False,,False,False,False,False,False,"Two underground storage tanks (10,000-gallon gasoline and 12,000-gallon diesel) were removed in early March 1998 from the Reynolds School District's bus barn, along with approximately 150 tons of PCS.  Shallow groundwater (10 ft bgs) was monitored for a couple of quarters, finding low levels of BTEX, but the work apparently stopped in November 1998.

