12019,29-99-0049,29,99,0049,,1999-01-15,1999-03-18 13:49:10,"STRANAHAN'S LAUNDRAMAT, HOT",209 PACIFIC,TILLAMOOK,97141,,False,4.0,GW,3.0,,False,True,False,,False,True,False,False,False,excavation of remaining soil.  report due,"In June of 2008, Grant Associates collected groundwater samples from Stranahan's laundromat site located at 209 Pacific Ave in Tillamook OR.  Analytical results from the sampling event showed elevated levels of cis-1,2 DCE, PCE & TCE in borings B-2, B-5, & B-6.  Specifically, the highest level of cis-1,2 was found at 504 ppb, PCE at 10.1 ppb & TCE at 84.4 ppb.
Due to presence of solvent contaminats in the groundwater beneath and presumably downgradient of the Stranahan's laundromat site, the HOT Program will administratively close the file and the site will be referred to the Cleanup Program for further evaluation.
RWA
HOT Project Manager

File transfered to Jim Orr 01-14-09",,31855.0,0.0,EMCMORR,2009-01-14 16:45:44.347
