11/2019:  USTs pulled in 8/2019. All tanks gone, property and west adjacent property will be redeveloped together.  Currently no monitoring occurring.  MWs remain in-place.  Need to see what next use will be.  GW is 1.25-5' btc, so propably would be a surface development.  Will need to evaluate for ss RBCs because of gw depth.  May need some additional soil gas sampling with development.  (RAH).

2.4.2015:  resent message to allan and brad bergrren  from 2013.  See if we can get this moving toward conditional closure. (RAH)

1/2013: got last of the 4 requested measurments and the gw mon.  go over with BR, prob. move to the indoor air samples as discussed with Niemi and hopefully can close w/condition, eg. if no longer a station, must address @ that time, but not worth it to continue on and on with QM unless a new release were to be noted. (RAH)

7/2012:  2 product measurement events, one more in oct. and see how thiings look.  however, diss. gw conc. are increasing at Mw-3 and 8. (RAH)

