12292,23-99-0011,23,99,0011,192.0,1999-03-23,1999-03-25 11:29:57,FAREWELL BEND INC.: Joy Travel Plaza,5945 US HWY 30,HUNTINGTON,97907,(541)869-2244,False,7.0,MATRIX,,,True,False,False,,False,False,False,False,False,"*** SEQUENT LUST COMMENTS : PCS DISCOVERED DURING DECOMM ACTIVITIES. *** May 99- overexcavation to matrix level- define pocket left next to building
