13803,03-99-1406,03,99,1406,,1999-12-21,1999-12-22 11:51:29,WILLAMETTE VIEW RETIREMENT HOT,12705 SE RIVER RD,MILWAUKIE,97222,,False,,,3.0,,False,True,False,,False,True,False,False,False,"The Willamette View Retirement site is located at 12705 SE River Road, but the actual contamination is centered at 13115 SE River Road.  Three private residences were demolished in 1999 to make way for a new building at the retirement community.  Each house had its own heating oil tank.  In December 1999, however, additional petroleum contamination was found in the area that was not associated with the HOTs.  Over 1,000 tons of PCS and close to 45,000 gallons of contaminated groundwater were removed from December 1999 to February 2000.  The site was added to the ECSI database (ECSI #2613) in June 2000 after Willamette View requested a review of their work through DEQ's Independent Cleanup Pathway (ICP).  The site dropped out of the ICP the following year after DEQ determined that additional investigation would be needed.  This HOT project was briefly reopened in 2010 after Willamette View decided to proceed with work, but since the work would be conducted under the oversight of the Cleanup program, the HOT project was soon Administratively Closed.",ECSI #2613,,9680.0,0.0,KDANA,2011-03-08 09:41:45.583
