15179,04-00-0856,04,00,0856,6892.0,2000-07-12,2000-07-12 15:36:03,SVENSEN MOBIL,40506 OLD HIGHWAY 30,ASTORIA,97103,(503) 325-1972,False,4.0,GW,4.0,,True,False,False,,False,False,False,True,False,"3.13.2020:  Preparing closure.  During decommissioning, some soil may have been excavated, but I can't find the K&S report.  Possibly some soil was removed. (RAH)

6.2019:  Still need items from 9.2018, RP is finishing closure report and will provide it to the current property owner.  (RAH)


9.2018:  Site is near closure.  need CMMP, final closure report.  Need to find out what property re-use will be.  Most likely, new slab on is ok, but no subsurface development unless eng controls or more vapor sampling.  Not likely to be used for res. purposes.  zoned rural community commerce.  

4/27/2018:  Met with Paula.  Will conduct 1 to 2 additional gw sampling events at MW-1 only.  concentrations were rebounding post injections.  (RAH)

10.2017:  3rd post-remedial gw mon. event completed in June 2017.  at next event, saga will provide write up of the 4 1/4s to see if meet residential Vi.  (RAH)

9/2016:  did injections.

5.2016: work plan, plan to remove building and remove some additional soil on west side.  proposing bioinjections also in pit and near mw-1.  need to recheck what RBCs they are looking to meet.  also, with gw levels being high at times, may need ss. gw numbers for vi.  (RAH)

12/2015:  in sept., 42 tons of soil excavated and transported to Cowlitz County Landfill in Castle Rock, WA.  Could not input disposal facility in the soil disposal section as the landfill is not an option. (RAH)

8.2015: Some additional delin. near wikiup, spot surface soil removal and either sg or ees for site for VI.  

Note re: ss point and vi, Soil issue, GW high too for urban res.  But soil >occ for vi.  
The vm points were to address off-prop.  Ss-1 was sampled only once and not in the hottest area.  In past we were not focusing on that area since tanks were not removed until 1997.  This area will need deed restriction.  From what I recall, the ss sampling was going to confirm for a building that would be built on existing slab.  So sg data is lacking in this area.



10/2013:  MW-8 installed on Wikiup water dist. property.  initial result ND, looks good for delineation.  will see how oct. results look and see where at w/project. (RAH)

7/13/12:replied to saga report.  requested items by 31 July.

3/19/12:  Data package submitted in Jan.  Met with Saga 15 March to discuss.  Report will be produced with recommendations by 15 May. (RAH)

