15749,23-00-0021,23,00,0021,2509.0,2000-09-11,2000-09-13 11:09:20,MORRISON OIL CO,318 N OREGON,ONTARIO,97914,(541) 286-1673,False,1.0,RBCA,4.0,,True,False,False,,False,False,False,False,False,"*** SEQUENT LUST COMMENTS : CONTAMINATION ENCOUNTERED AT BOTTOM OF TANK PIT, HOLE IN DIESEL TANK, SAMPLES TO LAB. *** 3 USTs removed. 415 tons of PCS excavated.",ECSI # 3538,"- In August of 2000, site removal work included 3 underground storage tanks (USTs). One 6,000 gallon gasoline UST and two 4,000 gasoline USTs were removed from a single tank nest.  Groundwater was found to be between 14 feet and 16 feet bgs in coarse sand.  Six soil samples were collected from the excavation at unspecified locations and analyzed for hydrocarbon identification. Fuel oil was identified, but not quantified in four of the soil samples. 

- In October 2000, approximately 415 tons of petroleum contaminated soil was excavated for off-site treatment and disposal at CCT Environmental in Caldwell, Idaho. Four soil samples were collected from the center of each sidewall at the bottom of the excavation (around 15 feet bgs) and analyzed for benzene, toluene, ethylbenzene, xylenes (BTEX), naphthalene, methyl-t-butyl-ether (MTBE), ethylene dibromide (EDB), and ethylene dichloride (EDC).  Toluene, Ethylbenzene, Xylene, Naphthalene were detected.

- The excavation remained open and 3 soil stockpiles remained on site for approximately 9 years.  

- In August 2009, eight soil samples were collected from the open excavation and nine soil samples were collected from the soil stockpiles and analyzed for hydrocarbon identification.  Heavy fuel oil was identified in one soil sample.  In 2011, the soil stockpiles were backfilled into the open excavation.  

- In October 2014, Subsurface soil samples were collected at 5 locations at various depths from 3 feet to 19 feet bgs.  Groundwater samples were collected at 8 locations. Groundwater was encountered between approximately 14 feet and 15 feet bgs.

- In September 2015, soil gas was sampled at 4 locations, including one sub-slab sample.",19682.0,0.0,DANDERS,2018-04-13 10:47:05.907
