17116,26-01-5479,26,01,5479,,2001-03-19,2001-03-20 11:45:55,HOME COMMING FINANCIAL NETWORK,1214 N WATTS ST,PORTLAND,97217,,False,7.0,MATRIX,1.0,CRT,False,True,False,,False,False,False,False,False,"Dan Obrest is conducting a demolition at 1213 N Watts.  ODOT is expanding the right-of-way in the area and Dan is giong to excavate the tank and potentially remove contaminated soil as part of the demolition.  I informed Dan that there should not be contamination above 500 mg/kg present, however if contamination was observed (stained soil, order etc) HOT should be contacted and additional characterization should be conducted.  Dan was informed that any soil removed from the tank area should be properly disposed of at an approved landfill (i.e. Hillsboro).  I also asked Dan to contact HOT after the removal was completed to let us know the amount of soil removed and disposed of at the landfull.  Demolition activities are scheduled to begin on November 20 2007.

Rebecca Wells-Albers
