19744,24-02-4004,24,02,4004,294.0,2002-02-22,2002-02-27 13:18:32,Centro Gas & Market,173 GRANT ST,WOODBURN,97071,(503)981-6661,False,8.0,,4.0,,True,False,False,,False,False,False,False,False,"*** SEQUENT LUST COMMENTS : RELEASE STOPPED DATE 1/22/02 WHEN TANKS WERE EMPTIED & RINSED. *** This is an ""abandoned tanks"" project site.  Release stopped 1/22/02 when tanks were pumped & rinsed.",24-19-0170 Centro Gas & Market II,"A limited site assessment was conducted on or around Feb 12, 2002, that determinesd that a release fromt he Waste oil UST had occured.  On October 2, 2006, Pike’s Unlimited mobilized to the site to permanently decommission the used-oil UST system.  During the decommissioning, the volume of the tank was determined to be 1,000 gallons, instead of 675 as previously registered with DEQ.  Approximately 22.42 tons of petroleum-contaminated soil were removed from the site and disposed of at Riverbend Landfill in McMinnville, Oregon.
Groundwater was not encountered during the decommissioning or the subsequent remedial excavation work. An NFA was issued. It should be noted that the investigation did not include any form of assessment in the area of the gasoline USTs or the fuel dispenser island.  All of the remedial excavation and confirmation sampling was confined to the area of the used-oil UST.",18133.0,0.0,GDECK,2019-03-01 10:50:53.383
