21447,26-02-0953,26,02,0953,,2002-09-18,2002-09-25 15:59:32,LIBERTY ST/FORMER SERVICE STATION,1294 E POWELL BLVD,GRESHAM,97080,,False,7.0,MATRIX,,,False,False,True,,False,False,False,False,False,"The City of Gresham encountered up to 7,500 ppm gasoline in the soil beneath Powell Blvd at the intersection with NE Liberty Avenue while digging a trench for a 12"" water line in September 2002.  A total of 31.93 tons of PCS were excavated.  Record searches identified a former Atlantic Richfield service station at the site (in the eastbound lanes of Powell Blvd).

