Erik Anderson (PBS) observed tank filled with sand, decomm'd to earlier standard.  No tank permit required.  JLP 1/6/03.",Pjt Mgr = BCS/RHR,"DEQ issued a No Further Action letter for the site on August 8, 2005. DEQ’s NFA identified vapor intrusion into buildings and use of groundwater at the site as a possible future risks; and stipulated use of vapor barriers or other vapor mitigation strategies for buildings constructed at the site in the future. It also indicated that groundwater from the site should not be used for domestic uses.  The Addendum to the 2005 NFA provides additional conclusions pertaining to risks to adjacent properties from vapor intrusion was issued on January 23, 2018.",47956.0,0.0,JGLASS,2019-03-08 17:45:59.217
