24844,26-04-0158,26,04,0158,9691.0,2004-02-10,2004-02-12 11:17:40,ALBERTSONS DISTRIBUTION CENTER #8252,17505 NE SAN RAFAEL,PORTLAND,97230,(503) 251-9360,False,,,,,True,False,False,,False,False,False,False,False,"Free Product was discovered in a tank pit observation well. 1inch of product was measured on 2/10/04. Diesel release was discovered between June 4 - 7, 2004. CAP sumitted in Sept 05 includes continued free product removal & monitoring; followed by confirmation soil sampling & GW monitoring for risk-based closure.  A new release, a truck hitting a pump island, was reported on November 28, 2006.  Report documenting product recovery actions and attempted confirmation investigation received in May 2009.  Report reviewed and comment letter sent on 6-24-09.  Borings C-5 and C-7 were not advanced, and these borings were intended to gauge groundwater conditions adjacent to the USTs; DEQ has requested that advancement of these borings using more robust drilling technology (JKS 9-21-09).  Hahn and Associates performed follow-up boring installation at locations C-5 and C-7 in March 2010.  TPH-D detected at concentration of 1,400 ppb in groundwater at C-5.  Borings C-17 and C-18 revealed soil impacted by TPH-D/TPH-O extended further west beneath the truck maintenance shop than anticipated. Delineation of soil impacts in area of truck shop not complete. Likewise, groundwater impacts down-gradient of C-5 is necessary. Comments to investigation report sent vial email on May 25, 2010. (JKS 5-25-10).j  Follow up investigation completed at site in April 2011.  Borings  (C-20, C-21, and C-22) advanced near the west of end of maintenance shop detected contamination in soil but at decreased levels.  Groundwater from boring C-19, advanced north of 2010 boring C-5, exhibited minimal impacts.  Further confirmation sampling does not appear to be warranted. HAI submitted a Risk-Based Closure Report on 12-16-11.  Based on favorable review, DEQ initiated comment period on proposed closure on 1-18-12.  Comments were not received.  Proceed with closure (JKS 2-23-12).",,,2738.0,2674.0,JSCHATZ,2012-02-23 15:59:21.450
