25050,29-04-0364,29,04,0364,726.0,2004-03-05,2004-03-15 16:23:28,NEHALEM ARCO STATION (FORMER),13015 'H' ST,NEHALEM,97131,(503) 368-5653,False,1.0,RBCA,,,True,False,False,,False,False,False,False,False,"3.2021: Most update RBC and CMMP were submitted in November 2020. Both are uploaded to DB. (RAH).

7/13/2020.  site ready for closure, public notice, need CMMP. (RAH)

9/13/2018:  Replied to CES on its 5/18/2018 rept.  Reply due 2 Nov.

3/15/17:  need add. inv.  3 borings in road, sample MWs 2-4.  if results near2 ppm gw, they can do presumtive remedy and no compliance gw sampling would be necessary afterward.  if >4ppm, mandatory treatment.  Reviewing workplan.  (RAH)


6/2015:  no progress. they were to complete some inv. needs followup with Statewide Env. Services.  (RAH)

2.2013:  statewide to prepare work plan for subslab sampling and rbc evaluation as final inv. stage and proposed remedy.   (RAH)

11.7.12:  going to collect on more 1/4 and risk eval.  ethylbenzene hit of 164 ppm @5' in soil during decommissioning, but gw has been like 3'.  may be a 2ndary mechanism in the eval.  all water so far passes vi.  only 2 pahs have failed for exc. worker in gw and those are on the other property, not sure if related to this cleanup, need to further eval. (RAH).

8.14.12:  reviewed MW install report submitted 8 Aug.  will continue with QM.  Asked for more detailed zoning information. (RAH)

2.13.12:  Field work being completed. (RAH)

12.20.11:  Followed up on status with Guy Tanz. MWs should have been installed and QM initiated.  Asked for estimated report submittal.  (RAH)

Approved work plan on 5/25/11, with some  additional investigation.  They will let me know when field work is scheduled.  (RAH, 5/25/11).


Wayne Riggs from Statewide Enviromental will pull tank on 11/29/04. All involved parties in agreement to begin cleanup. 7/26/05 SWLOA received, propose to aerrate soil.

Halversons last station operators, DEQ named as RP.  ODOT found substantial shallow contamination, with groundwater at 3 feet bgs.  

Insurance company contacted me regarding Halversons claim.  LLC",,,18449.0,0.0,RHOOD,2021-03-03 11:34:52.050
