25295,36-04-0609,36,04,0609,12196.0,2004-04-09,2004-04-13 14:22:39,Amity OABGI,EAST SIDE 300 BLOCK TRADE ST. SOUTH,AMITY,97101,(503) 835-3711,False,1.0,,4.0,,True,False,False,,False,False,False,False,False,*** SEQUENT LUST COMMENTS : SEE ALSO 36-03-2198 AMITY RIGHT-OF-WAY.  THIS NEW LOG# SET UP TO SEPARATE RP RESPONSIBILITIES. ***   This log # set up to separate RP responsibilities.,36-03-2198 Amity Right-of-Way,"Two automotive service and fueling stations formerly operated at the site between approximately the 1920s and 1990s.  Surface structures of both fuel related businesses were completely removed. A release of petroleum, impacting soil and groundwater, was discovered in 2003 when six (6) USTs were decommissioned by removal from the Trade Street South right-of-way.  A seventh UST (located beneath SE Sherman Street to the north) was decommissioned in 2006. Based on the results of the soil, groundwater and soil-gas monitoring, it appears that with limitations on use of the site, plans for future contaminated media management, and proper planning of future work, the remaining contamination is stable and should not pose a threat to human health and the environment given the current and reasonably likely future use.  The subject property is as of this writing occupied by Amity Foods & Coffee House.",82827.0,0.0,GDECK,2017-09-22 14:33:41.130
