26015,03-04-1330,03,04,1330,4445.0,2004-06-17,2004-07-09 09:47:33,CAROLYN MILLER PROPERTIES (TOWNE PUMP),1022 MOLALLA AVE,OREGON CITY,97045,(503) 758-1500,False,1.0,,,,True,False,False,,False,False,False,False,False,"Four gasoline USTs were removed from the site in June 2004, along with 575 tons of PCS.  Confirmation sampling showed low amounts of petroleum in the soil.  The site was backlogged when Stephanie Rawson left the program in September 2006.  Looks like a simple project.  (6/9/10 KPD).

Tim Brown reviewed the site information, and surrounding property information.  There are monitoring wells on the adjacent site and 3100 gallons of ""rain water"" was pumped from the excavation - indicating it is a groundwater site that needs further investigation.",,,20965.0,0.0,KDANA,2010-10-14 10:15:06.373
