27994,34-05-0790,34,05,0790,6613.0,2005-04-21,2005-04-21 15:51:55,BRIAN'S AUTO REPAIR II,495 E MAIN ST,HILLSBORO,97123,971-219-3175,False,7.0,,,,True,False,False,,False,False,False,False,False,"A leaking tank and leaking fuel line were reported at this site in 1987.  Five USTs were decommissioned and soil was cleaned up to a ""sight-and-smell"" standard.  (LUST #34-87-0001).  A corresponding ECSI site was subsequently closed out in March 1999 to match the LUST status.  (ECSI #370).  Two 8,000-gallon gasoline USTs at the site were placed into ""temporary closure"" in 2000.  Sampling in April 2005 found up to 4,290 ppm gasoline in the soil.  Additional sampling in February 2013 found only up to 51 ppm gasoline.  The two USTs were to be decommissioned in-place in March 2013.  The site owner/operator, Minh Duy Dao, wasn't planning on conducting any site investigation or cleanup in conjunction with the decommissioning.  (3/13/13 KPD)",LUST #34-87-0001 and ECSI #370,,8837.0,5140.0,KDANA,2013-03-13 08:37:41.063
