28899,34-05-1694,34,05,1694,,2005-08-09,2005-08-09 13:19:25,BOX PROPERTY,2458 SW 185TH AVE,ALOHA,97003,(503) 591-0653,False,4.0,GW,,,False,False,True,,False,False,False,False,False,"3.14.2021. Address updated to 2458, LUST DB had it as 2470 originally. (RAH).

5.27: PN over, no comments, proceeding with FIR. (RAH)

A 290-gallon gasoline UST was reportedly removed from this site in about 1987.  An investigation in August 2005 as part of a property transaction encountered gasoline in the soil.  Groundwater contamination was confirmed in March 2006.  About 22 tons of PCS were excavated from the tank pit in May 2006.  Confirmation sampling in August 2006 showed soil and groundwater contamination remaining in and around the tank pit.  The extent of contamination has not been determined.

Michael Box subsequently sold the property to Daljit Singh, who has not been cooperative in allowing access to the site.  (Mr. Box, through his insurance company, is still willing/able to pay for investigation and cleanup of the site).  Because the contamination may extend onto the neighboring property to the south, the investigation is now focusing on this adjacent property.  (11/24/10 KPD). Amended work plan from MSBA calls for advancement of three borings for temporary wells and three soil vapor points.  Access agreement submitted to off-site property owner.  Address information for new owner of site (Daljit Singh) not clear. (JKS 3-10-11)",,Site address was originally 2470. Updated in 2021 to 2458 SW 185th Ave.,118318.0,6010.0,RHOOD,2021-05-27 10:21:47.610
