30755,34-06-0942,34,06,0942,,2006-05-23,2006-05-23 09:43:02.000,WHEELER PROPERTY,7211 SW TAYLORS FERRY RD,TIGARD,97223,503-244-1997,False,1.0,RBCA,4.0,,False,False,True,,False,False,False,False,False,,,"A 675-gallon residential gasoline UST was removed from this site in July 2006, along with 12.67 tons of PCS.  Soil and shallow groundwater contamination was found to extend beneath the adjacent garage, and possibly beneath the house.  A sub-slab soil gas sample collected beneath the house in June 2008 found a moderately high concentration of gasoline-range hydrocarbons.  Indoor air sampling in March 2009 also showed hydrocarbons.  However, the contaminants appeared to be degraded and were relatively non-hazardous, and DEQ determined that the on-site residents were not at risk.",99328.0,7792.0,KDANA,2010-02-08 13:47:48.243
