31768,36-06-1954,36,06,1954,,2006-11-04,2006-11-06 07:58:42.000,Yamhill County,616 NE Davis St,MCMINNVILLE,97128,503-434-7471,False,7.0,,1.0,,False,True,False,,False,False,False,False,False,"A house was demolished at the site and during the demolition the Heating oil tank was discovered. The tank had been cut open and filled with rock and grit. The tank appeared to have leaked due to age the tank had holes in the bottom. Tank was cut open and the rock and grit sucked out and disposed of by COWLITZ CLEAN SWEEP. The contaminated soil was removed and disposed of at RIVER BEND LANDFILL. Site was sampled and backfilled. A matrix report will be sent to Oregon DEQ Gresham office

