31982,30-06-2167,30,06,2167,,2006-12-19,2006-12-20 10:13:16.467,"Simpson, Wayne",1205 Despain Ave,PENDLETON,97801,(541) 276-0264,False,7.0,,1.0,,False,True,False,,False,False,False,False,False,The HOT was decommissioned in-place on 12/12/06.  The results of two compliance soil samples collected through holes cut at each end of the tank detected diesel-range concentrations (TPH-Dx) of 68.8 ppm and 27.1 ppm.  The site will be assessed by a Soil Matix evaluation.,,,100509.0,9004.0,UPACHMA,2007-07-09 13:37:57.920
