32304,26-07-0287,26,07,0287,301.0,2007-03-02,2007-03-07 15:30:16.213,VU'S CAR CARE,7223 SE 39TH AVE,PORTLAND,97202,(503) 771-5457,False,7.0,,,,True,False,False,,False,False,False,False,False,"Two registered 10,000-gallon gasoline USTs were removed from this site in March 2007.  During the decommissioning, a third UST (6,000-gallons) was discovered which appeared to have been decommissioned in-place (by filling with sand).  A nearby soil sample, however, found 3,200 ppm gasoline.  Limited sampling to investigate the third UST was conducted in September 2008, and 22,100 ppm gasoline was found in the soil.  The site owner/ operator (Long Vu) apparently halted work at this point.

