32343,34-07-0326,34,07,0326,2256.0,2007-02-26,2007-03-13 08:48:21.607,SCHMIDT FARM,8325 SW ROSS ST,TIGARD,97224,,False,1.0,,,,True,False,False,,False,False,False,False,False,"also connected to files 34-99-0697 and 34-90-0463 (RAH 11.20.2013)
All PPA-CJ correspondence/documents are in this file and not the 2 above.

12/2016:  PPA certificate of completion finalized for Bonaventure.  (RAH)

June 2016:  PPA completion report submitted end of May.  (RAH)

Schmidts Sanitary Service decommissioned three tanks at the border of their property in 1990.  The site was issued an NFA.  In 2007 as part of a Phase I and II, high levels of gasoline and benzene were detected in the old tank pit area.  The site and the neighbors were on well water.  The impacts were detected primarily at the neighboring Mangold property.  The majority of contaminated soil was removed, and ten groundwater monitoring wells were installed.  The levels of impact decreased and SSS requested closure.  DEQ is requiring some follow-up soil gas sampling.  LLC 7-19-2010",LUST #34-90-0463 and #34-99-0697,See also 34-99-0697 and 34-90-0463,32533.0,0.0,RHOOD,2016-12-19 09:36:42.093
