32400,34-07-0383,34,07,0383,,2007-03-23,2007-03-28 07:49:55.703,"McNicholas, Michael",16465 SW Farmington Rd,BEAVERTON,97007,,False,7.0,,1.0,,False,True,False,,False,False,False,False,False,"On May 4, 2006, EcoTech conducted soil sampling around a heating oil tank at this site.

We identified a release, and according to our records, it was reported to DEQ on May 5, 2006 by our previous Operations Manager. 

Our records do not record a DEQ LUST I.D. number, only that it was reported on that date. 
 
