An Environmental Site Assessment in the summer of 2007 found gasoline, diesel, and motor oil in the soil and groundwater on the east edge and northeast corner of this site.  Delta Consultants submitted a work plan in March 2009 for the installation of temporary monitoring wells.  Three wells were installed in May 2009.  Soil and groundwater contamination was only encountered in one well, in the NE corner of the site.  DEQ requested additional investigation in September 2010 to determine the likely origin and extent of the contamination.  (9/30/10 KPD)",LUST #26-88-0080,,21245.0,0.0,RHOOD,2014-04-07 11:44:15.540
