33469,20-07-1451,20,07,1451,1388.0,2007-09-11,2007-09-25 18:33:59.090,Shell 121028 - River Rd,2690 River Rd,EUGENE,97404,,False,2.0,,4.0,,True,False,False,,False,False,False,True,False,"Evidence of a release was noted while reviewing laboratory analytical data from due diligence subsurface investigation conducted at the site. The groundwater samples from SBs - 1 and 2 show detection of 2-methylnaphthalene which has no RBC and Soil samples from SBs 1, 2 and 3 have detections of petroleum VOC or PAH Constituents in soil samples that are below the RBCs for leaching to GW. ... Kevin McCarthy, Delta Environmental 9/11/07.","LUST # 20-89-4180 (TEXACO River Road)
20-91-4116 (Texaco 553)","In August 2007, an environmental site assessment was completed on behalf of Shell Oil Company for this active service station at 2690 River Road in Eugene. Five borings (TK-SB1 through TKSB3, DS-SB4, and DS-SB6) were advanced to depths of 20 to 24 feet bgs to obtain soil and water samples. Groundwater was encountered in three of the borings at 15 feet bgs, and temporary wells consisting of 5-foot screens were installed. Soil was collected from 15 to 20 feet bgs. Petroleum contaminants were detected in soil from two borings at relatviely low concentrations, including gasoline at 24.4 parts per million (ppm), diesel at 22 ppm, oil at 14.8 ppm, and lead at 2.59 ppm. No other soil or groundwater samples contained gasoline, diesel, oil, VOCs, or PAHs above laboratory detection levels. Borings were placed 10 to 15 feet from the tank cavity and dispenser island. Based on the detections of petroleum in the 2007 investigation, DEQ requested additional assessment to confirm minimal contamination was present at the operating staion. This work was not completed, and Shell requested closure in 2012 based on historical release at the facility. DEQ re-evaluated site conditions and determined no further action was necessary based on the reported contamination levels and exposure pathways posing low risk to receptors.",1905.0,10419.0,CRODDA,2014-12-31 10:59:19.103
