33587,24-07-1569,24,07,1569,3607.0,2007-09-21,2007-10-15 13:25:39.147,Shell 124789-Commercial,4397 Commercial St SE,SALEM,97302,,False,1.0,,4.0,,True,False,False,,False,False,False,False,False,There are petroleum constituent concentration detections in groundwater above the ODEQ RBC screening levels in the attached lab reports for site #124789.  In SB-1 there is a detection of 55.5 mg/kg of GRO (RBC of 26). This is the first of multiple lab reports for this site.... Kevin McCarthy (Delta Environmental) 9/21/07.,24-97-4113 Truax Harris #77,,72774.0,10507.0,GDECK,2009-07-08 15:12:40.993
