33589,34-07-1571,34,07,1571,,2007-10-15,2007-10-15 14:31:27.827,"Behboobi, Brent",16605 SW Upper Boones Ferry Rd,TIGARD,97224,,False,1.0,,1.0,,False,True,False,,False,False,False,False,False,"SO1 @ 84 13,800 PPM
       SO2 @ 84 23,200 PPM",,,104901.0,10623.0,EMCMORR,2008-01-29 09:28:02.113
33590,15-07-1572,15,07,1572,1390.0,2007-09-25,2007-10-15 15:05:59.153,Shell 120507 - E Pine St,1125 E Pine St,CENTRAL POINT,97502,,False,2.0,,3.0,,True,False,False,,False,False,False,False,False,"Evidence of a release was noted during review of laboratory analytical results from due diligence site assessment done at the site. There are detections of petroleum compounds in soil samples above the ODEQ RBC screening levels for site #120507.  In SB-8 there is a detection of Benzene at 0.936 mg/kg (RBC - 0.0084) NWTPH-Gx at 2250 mg/kg (RBC 26) as well as the TMBs above the RBCs... Kevin McCarthy (Delta Environmental) 9/25/07.

DEQ determined that based on the data, this is the same contamination that was covered under the NFA for 15-93-0017 Texaco Service Station...Eric Clough, 10/17/08.",15-93-0017 TEXACO SERVICE STATION,,11187.0,10517.0,GDECK,2008-10-17 16:16:43.067
33591,26-07-1573,26,07,1573,,2007-10-15,2007-10-15 15:09:50.510,"BARBEE, JERRY",4105 SE 72nd Avenue,PORTLAND,97206,503-000-0000,False,,,3.0,,False,True,False,,False,False,False,False,False,"E80 = 57 ppm
