12.20: news release out, comments due 1/20/12.  nfa drafted, hyrdo approved, into manager for review. (RAH)

11/2001:  closure request in review (RAH)


Soil and groundwater samples were collected at this site in November 2007 as part of an environmental site assessment.  Relatively high concentrations of gasoline, diesel and oil were detected in the groundwater in the NW corner of the site.  Five groundwater monitoring wells were installed in April 2009, and quarterly monitoring began in January 2010.

