34022,03-08-0090,03,08,0090,6819.0,2008-01-29,2008-01-29 14:41:16.867,Joe's Distribution Center,9805 SW Boeckman Road,WILSONVILLE,97070,,False,,,4.0,,True,False,False,,False,False,False,False,False,"Contamination beneath both pump islands detected during removal of 12000 gallon diesel UST.  Pit water sample indicated DRO at concentration up to 24,000 ppb.  Grant Associates proposed additional investigation for delineating soila and groundwater but not authorized by RP.  Letter sent 3-12-09 requesting intentions by mid June 2009.  No response received to letter or March 2009.  Follow-up letter sent on October 1 2009.  Letter from deeded property owner received on October 8.  The letter mentioned the Joe's bankruptcy and indicated the UST obligations would be addressed when the settlement has been dispersed.  Letter from Joe's received October 14 - bankruptcy status is mentioned only.  It appears no work will be done on this project in the near future (JKS 10-20-09).  Call to RP on 12-1-09 to get update on settlement process (JKS 12-1-09).  Letter sent to RP asking for update on settlemetn proceedings by May 26, 2010 (JKS 4-23-10). On August 4, 2010, received signed Agreement for Services authorizing Grant Associates to proceed with implementing scope of work previously proposed by consultant.  Investigation was implemented in August 2010.  Analysis fof soill and groundwater samples showed that contamination did not extend significantly beyond the former UST basin.  Contamination in down-gradient direction well delineated.  Letter sent to consultant and RP on 12-14-10 requested additional data for BWUD.  Information received on 1-31-11. Letter soliciting comments on the proposed closure sent 3-3-11. No comments received during comment period which ended 4-8-11 (JKS 4-28-11).  Draft NFA submitted to Hydrogeologist and await comments/approval (JKS 6-8-11).",LUST #03-95-0326,,103887.0,11031.0,LKENT,2011-08-30 08:35:46.720
