35201,34-08-1262,34,08,1262,9949.0,2008-09-25,2008-09-29 10:19:23.383,DICK'S COUNTRY DODGE III,767 SW BASELINE,HILLSBORO,97123,(503) 640-1050,False,,,,,True,False,False,,False,False,False,False,False,"Two previous releases on record for site (34-89-0244 and 34-93-0045). November 2008 Phase I ESA recommended assessment of former hydraulic lifts and of a pocket of contamination left in place in 1993.In June 2008, soil borings were advanced in these areas for collection of soil and groundwater samples. Soil and groundwater samples contained diesel and/or heavy oil range hydrocarbons above MRLs and/or RBC standards.  In October and November of 2008, impacted soils were removed.  No report documenting this work received by DEQ to date. Work plan for installation of four monitoring wells received by DEQ in February 2008. Excavation data will be incorporated into the well installation report.  Work plan approved with comments on 3-02-09.  Remedial Action services report documenting excavation and well installation was received in September 2009.  Groundwater monitoring performed between April 2009 and March 2010. Groundwater monitoring suspension approved in July 2010.  Comments provided on a risk-based assessment in letter dated 7-21-10.  Additional data collection and discussion requested for risk-based closure (JKS 12-17-10). No further information  to document case for risk-based closure received.   ODOT plans to do work in ROW adjacent to site and may perform investigation beforehand.    (JKS 12-14-11)",,,81021.0,0.0,JSCHATZ,2011-12-14 15:17:34.903
