35425,34-08-1486,34,08,1486,,2008-10-21,2008-12-08 10:52:57.587,Adams/Wheeler Property,525 NE 28th Ave,HILLSBORO,97124,,False,1.0,,4.0,,False,False,True,,False,False,False,False,False,"A prospective purchaser of the residential property observed ""obvious"" contamination around a 500-gallon UST in October 2008.  400 gallons of product were pumped from the UST in January 2009, and 6.81 tons of PCS were excavated through a hole cut in the bottom of the UST.  Gasoline (5,320 ppm) and diesel (2,040 ppm) were encountered in soil, and gasoline (456 ppb) was encountered in groundwater (which is 3 ft bgs).  Additional samples to determine extent of contamination were all ND.  May be a simple risk-based closure.  (7/1/09 KPD).  Report review indicates lateral delineation of impacts near sample E(OT)77"" may not be complete.  No description of where soil impacts were observed - no confirmation samples collected from north or south sidewall, despite removal of soil (JKS 07-27-09).  Letter dated 8-3-09 requested clarification of information in report and additional investigation in area of sample E(OT)77"".  In letter dated 9-2-09, Alpha clarified points raised in DEQ letter of 8-3-09.  Door-to-door survey of adjoining properites revealed no wells and groundwater contamination was limited to the site.  GW sample advanced adjacent to end of tank with documented contamination was ND for TPH and constituents. Public comment phase of project has been reached (JKS 11-19-09).  In letters dated 23 November 2009 and 01 December 2009, the propery owner and owner for six adjacent properties were notified of comment period.  Despite confirmation of ownership information with WA County, letters to Steven and Jocelyn Williams (561 NE 28th Avenue) and Ronald and Teresa Baughman (569 NE 28th Avenue) and MC Aristeo (2733 NE Laura Ct.)were returned as undeliverable, or unable to forward.  I feel a duly diligent attempt to notify adjacent property owners was made and draft NFA should be prepared for Hydro and Tanks Manager approval d (JKS 1/11/10).",,,109765.0,0.0,LKENT,2010-04-15 09:46:12.263
