35452,03-08-1513,03,08,1513,,2008-12-17,2008-12-26 11:16:28.680,"Stribakos, Conrad",19191 SE Borges Rd,DAMASCUS,97089,,False,1.0,,1.0,,False,True,False,,False,False,False,False,False,"1,400 and 1,070 ppm detected at 7 feet ground surface in the apparent previous location of a heating oil tank.  Location determined by tracing copper lines to where they ended at corner of residence. Tank gone.  Apparently removed by someone in the past. GROUNDWATER encountered approx. 5 feet below ground surface.  Residence is on DRINKING WELL. Drinking well on property.

Rejection letter mailed 1/12/09.  Drinking water well impact (TOHDx 90 ppb - RBC is 88 ppb).  Responsible parties notified of well impact and told not to use well for drinking or cooking.  Residence currently unoccupied and well serves residence only (no offsite service).

Mike Golberg conducting follow up sampling 1/8/09.  Drinking water well does not appear to be affected by HOT source area.  Site will be closed under HOT Program but referred to Cleanup Program for further assessment of impacted onsite drinking water well.  RWA 1/15/2009

HOT site was closed out 1/15/2009 and final closure letter signed by Ed Druback.",,Site was referred to Clean-up Department and is now under ECSI #5129.,0.0,12457.0,IGAFFNE,2016-01-05 10:26:33.167
