35502,23-09-0031,23,09,0031,1381.0,2009-01-21,2009-01-21 16:10:41.130,GOODMAN OIL CO. EXXON-Nyssa,304 MAIN,NYSSA,97913,208-342-4588,False,1.0,,4.0,,True,False,False,,False,False,False,False,False,,"General Farm (ECSI 4555, LUST 23-96-0038).  A lot of data collected for General Farm is applicable to Goodman Oil.","(June 2011) A site assessment was performed in at the adjacent General Farm Supply site (LUST we-96-0038, ECSI 4555, 312 Main St) in December 2008 to delineate the full extent of soil and gw contamination associated with their release.  A total of 23 soil borings were advanced with 15 borings being completed as gw monitoring wells (MW-1 to MW-15). The assessment  documented releases at two other sites: the former Goodman Oil service station (LUST 23-09-0031, this site) located at 312 Main Street and the former Nyssa Laundromat site (ECSI 2949) located at 18 N 3rd Street. These plumes from the sites (General Farm, Goodman Oil, and Nyssa Laundromat) are co-mingled. 

As part of the remedial action for the General Farm Supply site, an Easement & Equitable Servitude was recorded on the Goodman Oil property that prohibits gw use and residential use and requires the installation of a vapor barrier under any future buildings.  This E&ES was required to address both the General Farm Supply and Goodman Oil releases.  

The UST tanks and piping were either removed or abandoned in place in August 2010.  A conditional NFA was issued on June 14, 2011.

Select site documents are availible in the Site Document section of this database.",18865.0,0.0,KROBERT,2011-06-14 09:57:31.153
