35595,34-09-0123,34,09,0123,12159.0,2009-02-23,2009-02-23 13:57:22.263,MERRITT #1,14975 SW WALKER RD,BEAVERTON,97006,(503) 371-0722,False,4.0,,4.0,,True,False,False,,False,False,False,True,False,"Release reported during UST decommissioning.  In December 2008, a 15,000-gallon gasoline UST was decommissioned. Spill bucket on the 20-day report received for site.  Two soil samples collected from native soil in excavation did not exhibit detectable TPH (using HCID) or TPH-G.  Water sample collected from pit exhibited TPH-G (5,980 ppb) and BTEX (benzene = 284 ppb). t.  .  Kleinfelder recommended installation of monitoring wells at the site to characterize groundwater.  In October 2009, network of four monitoring wells (KMW01 through KMW04) installed at site.  Soil samples collected from well borigs did not exhibit gasoline hydrocarbons or constituents at levels exceeding reporting limits. Initial sampling of monitoring wells likewise did not reveal evidence of impact by petroleum hydrocarbons or consitutents.  Additional quraterly monitoring events in January, April, and July 2010.  The third quarter 2010 event had TPH-G and benzene detected for first time in wells KMW02 and KMW03 at not insignificant concentrations. Kleinfelder believes a release may have occurred near KMW03 (broken vapor line suggested). Addtional quarterly monitoring recommended to further evaluate seasonal variation in groundwater quality. *Additional delineation may be in order*.  Kleinfelder has conducted 5 quarterly events and has requested suspension.  CSM received 3-9-11. DEQ concurs that contamination appears to be restricted to site boundaries.  Levels of gasoline and constituents in groundwater do not exceed RBC standards for complete exposure pathways under urban residential and occupational worker scenarios. Comment solicitation letter mailed 4-11-11.   Draft NFA submitted to Hydrogeologist and await comments/approval (JKS 6-8-11). Site re-opened on : 8/3/2011 By Lynne Kent. Previous Final Invoice Request Date: 8/3/2011.",LUST #34-97-0406,,28516.0,0.0,LKENT,2011-10-24 09:07:49.337
