No PCS was removed, reportedly due to the cost.  The on-site well was 75 ft from the UST, but tapped an aquifer over 100 ft bgs.  The site scores very high for potential risks but actual risks are probably less.  Ability-to-pay forms were sent to Unger Farms in October 2010 but no response was received.  (7/17/13 KPD)",,,113855.0,13783.0,KDANA,2013-07-17 13:53:06.777
