20-20-1049 Truck N Travel III",ODOT did a preliminary investigation along a route they are expanding and found groundwater contamination in 11/09.  Four wells were installed in 8/10. Quarterly samples were taken over a two year period. Little contamination was found in the soils and groundwater near the pump islands and tanks at this site.  The initial contamination appears to be limited in area based on a geoprobe investigation directly adjacent to the original release.,19039.0,0.0,GDECK,2020-11-18 17:37:11.827
