36787,26-09-1314,26,09,1314,4215.0,2009-12-30,2010-01-05 12:38:51.863,Franz Bakery,340 NE 11th Ave,PORTLAND,97232,503-961-2183,False,7.0,,,,True,False,False,,False,False,False,False,False,"Contaminated soil was discovered beneath a dispenser at the site in December 2009, but cleanup didn't occur until August 2011, when the entire UST system was removed.  Three tanks were decommissioned: a 6,000-gallon gasoline tank, a 12,000-gallon diesel tank, and a 10,000-gallon diesel tank.  Soil sampling found up to 357 ppm gasoline and 3,120 ppm diesel.  A total of 164 tons of PCS was removed (down to 19.5 ft bgs).  Confirmation sampling found no residual contamination.  No groundwater was encountered.  This looks like a simple Soil Matrix cleanup.  (4/2/12 KPD)",,,3623.0,0.0,KDANA,2012-04-02 15:34:03.350
