37032,26-10-0246,26,10,0246,4014.0,2010-03-25,2010-03-25 17:09:20.700,Drew Paints III,1525 NW 23rd Ave,PORTLAND,97210,,False,7.0,,4.0,,True,False,False,,False,False,False,False,False,"A 1,000-gallon UST (reportedly a former HOT) was removed from this site in April 2010.  A soil sample beneath the tank found 17,700 ppm gasoline and 43,600 ppm diesel.  A total of 14.57 tons of PCS were excavated, and confirmation sampling found no detectable Gx or Dx.  All samples were analyzed by Wy'East.  However, as no groundwater was encountered, the site appears to be a simple Soil Matrix cleanup.

A previous release at the site (26-99-0070) was referred to Cleanup in November 2004 when 48.9 ppm PCE was detected in the soil.  The Cleanup program does not appear to have taken further action at the site.  See ECSI #4465.  (10/5/10 KPD)",LUST #26-96-0448 and #26-99-0070.  Also ECSI #4465,,872.0,14053.0,LKENT,2011-04-18 15:53:31.773
