37414,03-10-0627,03,10,0627,,2010-06-25,2010-06-25 15:24:48.157,Premier Assets,29855 S Gordon Rd,COLTON,97017,,False,1.0,,4.0,,False,False,True,,False,False,False,False,False,"A 500-gallon fuel tank was removed from this site in July 2010.  Up to 659 ppm gasoline and 1,250 ppm diesel were detected in the soil around the south end of the tank.  The contamination (about 3.7 cubic yards) extends from about 6-10 feet bgs.  Static water in the on-site drinking water well (65 feet away) was measured at 12.5 feet bgs.  The gasoline exceeds the leaching to groundwater RBC of 28 ppm and consequently poses a long-term threat to the well.  DEQ recommended removal of the PCS and confirmation sampling, which reportedly occurred August 21-22.  [Note: the original lab data for this site was from Wy'East].  (8/30/10 KPD).  In July 2010, a groundwater sample was collected from the site water well.  Analysis revealed gasoline, diesel, and oil-range hydrocarbons, BTEX, and PAHs were not present at concentratiosn exceeding laboratory MRLs.  No evidence for imapct to site groundwater observed.  In August 2010, an aadditional 10.7 tons of impacted soil was removed from the southern end of the UST exavation.  Four confirmation soil samples collected from margins of excavation did not exhibit gasoline, diesel, or oil-range hydrocarbons at concentrations exceeding reporting limits.  Soil contamination removed to within Soil Matrixl Level II standards (80 mg/kg gasoline and 500 mg/kg diesel/oil); No evidence of groundwater contamination.  Closure under Soil Matrix rules appropriate (JKS 9-8-10).",,,116371.0,14417.0,LKENT,2010-09-30 08:23:39.183
37416,03-10-0629,03,10,0629,,2010-06-24,2010-06-28 14:04:47.197,Ludahl,15364 S Springwater Rd,OREGON  CITY,97068,,False,1.0,,1.0,,False,True,False,,False,False,False,False,False,Original pit water sample above solubility.   Soil removal conducted and groundwater pumped.  Source area resampled and below solubility for TPH-Dx.  Further VI pathway assessment not necessary.  RWA 7/15/10,,,0.0,14399.0,EMCMORR,2011-03-16 08:36:18.657
