37487,34-10-0700,34,10,0700,,2010-07-14,2010-07-15 08:23:57.540,Washington County Residential,400 NW Cornelius Pass Rd,HILLSBORO,97124,,False,,,3.0,,False,True,False,,False,False,False,False,False,"I apoligize for being late in reporting this.  We collected two soil samples after removing the tank, east end contained 2,060 ppm diesel, west end was ND.  We removed 6.53 tons of soil on March 2nd.  Confirmation samples were ND.  Ground water was not encountered.",This file is a duplicate.  Please see file # 26-09-1278 for work on this site.,,113815.0,14485.0,LLO,2016-03-25 13:41:14.430
