37755,26-10-0967,26,10,0967,,2010-09-24,2010-09-24 15:20:52.203,"Hodes, Stanley",1000 E Burnside St,PORTLAND,97214,503-293-5909,False,0.0,,0.0,,False,True,False,0.0,False,False,False,False,False,Tank removed during Burnside street improvements in Sept 2010.  Hydrocarbon impacted soil at fill pipe end (east end) beneath former tank location.  Unknown extent of contamination.  No visual impacts to soil at time of soil removal.,,,117569.0,14759.0,EMCMORR,2010-09-24 15:20:52.203
