38159,26-11-0102,26,11,0102,1483.0,2011-02-03,2011-02-08 07:07:50.883,Avamere Crestview of Portland,6530 SW 30th Ave,PORTLAND,97239,,False,7.0,,4.0,,False,False,True,,False,False,False,True,False,simple matrix closure,,,77039.0,15158.0,RHOOD,2011-06-08 08:53:23.740
38160,03-11-0103,03,11,0103,12398.0,2011-02-07,2011-02-09 11:54:20.823,Mulino Chevron,26611 S Hwy 213,MULINO,97042,503-484-3161,False,7.0,,,,True,False,False,,False,False,False,False,False,"ODOT discovered an abandoned 250-gallon UST adjacent to the Mulino Chevron property during a construction project in February 2011.  Initial sampling found 1,970 ppm gasoline at 7 ft bgs.  The tank was removed along with 21.46 tons of PCS.  Confirmation sampling found only 8.19 ppm gasoline at 5 ft bgs.  The area  backfilled and paved as part of the roadway.  Groundwater was not not encountered during any of the construction activities.  •    The adjacent site is a gas station and store, more than 100 feet away and connected to municipal water.  A beneficial use survey located a well approximately 250 feet to the south, on the adjacent property, completed to 86 feet bgs.  Based on the inferred regional groundwater flow direction, occurrence of low-permeability units in the subsurface and limited depth of soil contamination, impacts to area groundwater and this well are highly unlikely.  Concentrations in soil below all other RBCs.  NFA to be issued in March 2019.",LUST #03-92-0336,"ODOT discovered an abandoned 250-gallon UST adjacent to the Mulino Chevron property during a construction project in February 2011.  Initial sampling found 1,970 ppm gasoline at 7 ft bgs.  The tank was removed along with 21.46 tons of PCS.  Confirmation sampling found only 8.19 ppm gasoline at 5 ft bgs.  The area  was backfilled and paved as part of the roadway.  Groundwater in the area is around 18-20 feet below ground surface so not encountered during any of the construction activities.  Drinking water in area supplied by Mulino Water District.",31118.0,0.0,AFARRIS,2019-03-21 09:14:39.153
