38169,13-11-0112,13,11,0112,,2011-02-14,2011-02-15 07:10:40.150,"Daquila , Catherine",429 S Court Ave,BURNS,97720,435-636-3359,False,1.0,,1.0,,False,True,False,,False,False,False,False,False,"Cinch Enterprises LLC was hired by a third party to inspect the soil around the HOT. The HOT is still in use. Upon hand excavation to the tank bottom at the ends. We encountered soil heavily impacted with heating oil and free product pooling in the excavation. This was after hours on Friday February 11, 2011. The home is vacant, the owners have moved to Colorado. The owners have been notified and they are trying to get a local jobber to pump out the remaining fuel. Cinch has offered this service to them as well as decommissioning and remediation. We are discussing price.",,,119033.0,15177.0,TBROWN,2011-05-17 07:04:07.940
