39444,24-12-0070,24,12,0070,,2012-01-23,2012-01-30 07:43:33.073,Colonial Building LLC,687 Court St NE,SALEM,97301,,False,1.0,,1.0,,False,True,False,,False,False,False,False,False,"The heating oil UST is located beneath the sidewalk in front of the building.  The tank is orientated perpendicular to Court Street.  The tank is approximately four (4) feet in diameter by eight (8) feet long (675-gallons).  The tank has not been in use since 2003.  The tank was likely installed in 1951 when the building was built.  Groundwater impact is unknown but likely.  The tank was pumped on January 20, 2012 concurrent with the site assessment activities (push probes), laboratory results are pending.  Approximately 110 gallons of residual product and water was removed from the tank.",,,0.0,16476.0,MJGILLE,2012-02-21 09:55:46.040
