39980,26-12-0606,26,12,0606,,2012-05-29,2012-06-05 17:23:24.620,Perrys on Fremont,2333 NE Fremont Street,PORTLAND,97212,,False,7.0,,4.0,,False,False,True,,False,False,False,False,False,"Assessment in preparation for sale of property.  Historic service station at current parking lot for restaurant.  Low to moderate concentrations of TPH-Gx and TPH-Dx at former UST locations.

East Parcel:
In May 2012, a single low concentration of heavy oil contamination was detected at the east end of a suspected former UST pit (680 ppm).  Howvever, follow-up quantification using method NWTPH-Dx was not performed.on this sample.  containing the restaurant.  In follow up investigation, a sample was collected at the same approximate location and depth as the heavy oil detection and tested using Method NWTPH-Dx.  No detections reported. As a result, because there were no other detections, DEQ determined that a Focused NFA could be issued for the East Parcel.

Based on remaining concerns with future vapor intrusion risks, contamination at the West Parcel will be addressed at a later date (JKS 9-30-13)",,,124092.0,16974.0,JSCHATZ,2013-09-30 14:51:40.280
