41191,26-13-0231,26,13,0231,8835.0,2013-02-26,2013-03-07 09:00:32.270,FRIENDLY FOOD MART,6010 NE KILLINGSWORTH,PORTLAND,97218,503-860-7152,False,7.0,,4.0,,True,False,False,,False,False,False,False,False,"In February 2013, a release was reported under the east dispenser located north of the building.  Contamination was discovered under the east dispenser at a depth of two feet bgs.  The leak was repaired and the station was put back in service. In April 2013, Point Source Solutions excavated contaminated soil benath the east dispenser island. A sample collected at a depth of two feet bgs contained high concentrations of gaosline and BTEX, in excess of occupational worker RBCs for vapor intrusion. Additional soil was removed and confirmation sample collected at 10.5 feet bgs did not contain detectable gaosline, diesel or heavy oil.  Delineatino samples collected south and north of the dispenser also did not contain detectable gasoline,diesel or heavy oil.  Approximately 9.5 tons of contaminated soil were removed from the area.  Groundwater was not encountered (JKS 5-30-14)",LUST #26-91-0054 & #26-10-0957,"In February 2013, a release was reported under the east dispenser located north of the building.  Contamination was discovered under the east dispenser at a depth of two feet bgs.  The leak was repaired and the station was put back in service. In April 2013, Point Source Solutions excavated contaminated soil benath the east dispenser island. A sample collected at a depth of two feet bgs contained high concentrations of gaosline and BTEX, in excess of occupational worker RBCs for vapor intrusion. Additional soil was removed and confirmation sample collected at 10.5 feet bgs did not contain detectable gaosline, diesel or heavy oil.  Delineatino samples collected south and north of the dispenser also did not contain detectable gasoline,diesel or heavy oil.  Approximately 9.5 tons of contaminated soil were removed from the area.  Groundwater was not encountered (JKS 5-30-14)",24003.0,0.0,JSCHATZ,2014-05-30 14:10:54.097
