41254,20-13-0294,20,13,0294,,2013-03-18,2013-03-18 12:19:16.557,"Zosel, Paul",70 W 35th Pl,EUGENE,97405,541-636-7465,False,1.0,,1.0,,False,True,False,,False,False,False,False,False,"I initially reported this release on March 11, 2013.  I'm resubmitting this information because I have not received confirmation and may have messed up the submittal.

