41358,34-13-0398,34,13,0398,5621.0,2013-04-08,2013-04-10 17:19:34.800,FRONTIER CORNELIUS SUPPORT CENTER 5560,198 N 19TH AVE,CORNELIUS,97113,(916) 714-4295,False,4.0,,,,True,False,False,,False,False,False,False,False,"A 12,000-gallon UST was removed from this site in April 2013.  No petroleum products were detected in nine confirmation soil samples collected around the tank and dispenser.  However, a pit water sample from 9.5 feet bgs found gasoline and VOCs.  DEQ sent a letter to Frontier Communications in July 2013 saying that the extent of groundwater contamination needed to be determined.  No response was received, and the project was backlogged at the end of April 2014.  (4/30/14 KPD)",LUST #34-92-0264,,21738.0,0.0,KDANA,2014-04-30 09:42:39.130
