42123,26-13-1163,26,13,1163,12454.0,2013-08-28,2013-08-28 15:59:54.470,C.G. CONSTRUCTION,1801 NW IRVING ST,PORTLAND,97209,(503) 226-1078,False,7.0,,,,True,False,False,,False,False,False,False,False,"Two 275-gallon gasoline USTs holding product were discovered beneath the sidewalk along Irving Street at this site in August 2013.  Both USTs were decommissioned by removal; no release was detected.  A former pump island on the corner of NW 18th & Irving was subsequently removed, finding 2,230 ppm gasoline and 1,930 ppm diesel in the soil.  A total of 3.58 tons of PCS were removed, and confirmation sampling found no residual contamination.  DEQ received an UST Decommissioning report in November 2013 but no Cost Recovery Agreement was submitted.  (12/18/14 KPD)",,,129450.0,0.0,KDANA,2014-12-18 15:39:47.357
