42624,03-13-1664,03,13,1664,3196.0,2013-12-20,2013-12-20 15:40:30.697,Gladstone City Shops,18595 Portland Avenue,GLADSTONE,97027,503-209-5158,False,1.0,,,,True,False,False,,False,False,False,False,False,"A 6,000-gallon gasoline UST and a 3,000-gallon diesel UST were decommissioned by removal from this site in late October 2013.  A soil sample from the east end of the tank pit at 12.5 ft bgs showed 112 ppm oil by Dx.  Groundwater was also encountered.  In reporting the release, the contractor stated no further action was necessary because the concentration was below the 500 ppm Soil Matrix Level 2 standard.  No reports were received.

