The City of Albany is constructing a new intersection in the area. The tank was located in the right-a-way and found when the city was excavating. We were asked to remove the tank and all contamination so they could continue working, the same day they found it. We had a conversation with Bob McCoy and he allowed us to pull the tank. All contamination was removed and no ground water was encountered.
