45158,29-15-0770,29,15,0770,,2015-06-08,2015-06-08 08:10:22.930,Wiles Property,110 Garibaldi Ave,GARIBALDI,97118,,False,1.0,,3.0,,False,False,True,,False,False,False,False,False,"The tank had been removed from beneath the sidewalk along Garibaldi Avenue during the replacement of the sidewalk in 1992, on a property that is not owned by Ms. Wiles.  The tank dated back to the 1920s.

In 2015, contamination in the southern portion of the former Wiles proeprty revealed gasoline impacts of a few hundred parts per million in soil, with largely ND levels of .  A groundwater sample collected nearest the highest gasoline detections did not contain detectable concetnrations of petroleum hydrocarbons or constituents.  The area of shallow soil contamination is limited in extent.  
