45684,26-15-1296,26,15,1296,12523.0,2015-09-14,2015-09-15 08:46:45.250,Pepper Box Cafe,932-940 SE Morrison Street,PORTLAND,97214,,False,1.0,,4.0,,True,False,False,,False,False,False,False,False,,,"A 2,800-gallon waste oil tank was discovered at the site in January 2015.  Soil samples were collected at the site in August and October 2015, finding gasoline, diesel and heavy oils along with arsenic, lead and PAHs.  Sub-slab vapor samples were collected in February 2016, finding low levels of gasoline, diesel and BTEX.  The waste oil tank was decommissioned by filling in-place in August 2016.  Four groundwater samples were collected at the site in April 2017, finding low levels of gasoline, diesel and PAHs.  Only the soil contaminants were present at concentrations of concern.  A Contaminated Media Management Plan was prepared in January 2018 to manage the soils, and a deed restriction was recorded with the property in March 2018 requiring compliance with the CMMP.  No further actions are necessary.",143008.0,22906.0,KDANA,2018-08-06 07:36:30.463
