45713,22-15-1325,22,15,1325,3984.0,2015-09-14,2015-09-18 17:59:03.167,ARCO AM/PM,33200 HIGHWAY 34 SE,ALBANY,97322,,False,1.0,,4.0,,True,False,False,,False,False,False,True,False,"SUSPECTED: Results of (3) turbine sumps waters samples were collected and tested, as requested by the DEQ. (Due to compliance inspection and sump alarms).
Follow up site assessment work plan from BBA approved for implementation.  Hrose self-assigned to project as work being conducted under enforcement MAO.  Site assessment results will confirm or refute initial release reported by PumpPipeTank.  2/9/2016 rhr","22-91-4186, ARCO 4476
22-92-4228, Arco AM-PM #5897","The site was originally developed as a fuel station in 1971. The current fuel system and convenience store were constructed in 1992. During the 1992 redevelopment, contamination was discovered and addressed under LUST #22-92-4228. In 2015, a fuel dispenser was damaged and released an unknown amount of gasoline to the ground. Only groundwater samples northwest of the dispenser area were found to be impacted with gasoline. The damaged fuel dispenser was repaired and no additional remedial actions occurred. There appears to be some residual groundwater impacts on the western portion of the site. MTBE is consistently present at concentrations below residential risk based screening levels, which may indicate residual contamination from the previous release. The onsite drinking water well is cross to up gradient of the release and was sampled once in the months following this release and did not appear impacted at that time. Contaminant concentrations in onsite monitoring wells declined quickly and future impacts to the well are unlikely. The site and surrounding properties are expected to remain commercial and use private drinking water wells.This decision only applies to this release and did not reevaluate the conditions of the previously closed releases (LUST #22-91-4186, 22-92-4228) or the release on the neighboring property to the west (LUST #22-06-0975, 22-08-1533, ECSI 5044).",3493.0,22904.0,CRICHAR,2019-01-29 10:01:53.130
