46026,24-15-1638,24,15,1638,,2015-11-18,2015-11-24 16:03:24.360,Commercial Property,1092 BROADWAY ST NE,SALEM,97301,,False,1.0,,4.0,,True,False,False,,False,False,False,False,False,,,"The site was a gasoline service station prior to 1970 when it became and has remained a used car lot. No records exist of the removal of fuel tanks from the property, and the cause of contamination is unknown. The property was scanned with ground penetrating radar, and borings were placed in areas of possible underground storage tank locations.  Borings showed the areas to be consistent with backfilled excavations. Soil and groundwater are contaminated on the northern portion of the site with impacts bordering the Belmont Street right-of-way. Contaminated soil and groundwater remain on site adjacent to Belmont Street. The site is currently and expected to remain a commercial facility and is connected to a municipal water supply.",138254.0,23237.0,CRICHAR,2016-09-30 10:29:25.137
