6/7/18: Sent HOT record to the Salem office. IG","The Valpak Road site is composed of two tax lots located in an industrial use area of Salem. Two releases occurred at the subject property and were separately reported: one associated with a former heating oil tank (LUST 24-15-1741) and the second related to a historical gasoline underground storage tank (LUST 24-16-0252). Contamination remains in portions of the site that are below acceptable risk levels for general industrial property use. Gasoline, diesel, and oil and its constituents are located in soil and groundwater from approximately 8 to 20 feet. Restrictions to groundwater and residential use are in place through an EES filed with Marion County.",154106.0,23366.0,GDECK,2020-09-30 14:59:07.783
