06-16-0741 Coos Bay Pac. Pride II","(8/17/21 DEH) In November 2015 a sheen was reported on the water in a drainage ditch that parallels the site on its eastern boundary. DEQ opened this LUST file based on the reported sheen, however it is likely that the sheen is at least in part caused by contamination remaining at this site from a diesel release in 1991. That LUST (06-91-0096) was given an NFA in 2003, with contamination left in place.  DEQ has requested additional assessment including a groundwater investigation to determine the nature and extent of groundwater at this site associated with the 1991 release as well as a more recent spill bucket release of gasoline in 2016 (LUST 06-16-0741).",16410.0,0.0,DHANSON,2021-08-17 16:56:18.613
