46388,26-16-0200,26,16,0200,,2016-02-23,2016-02-23 15:13:22.347,SE 9th and Belmont,915 SE Belmont Street,PORTLAND,97214,,False,1.0,,4.0,,False,False,True,,False,False,False,False,False,,,"Two 1,000-gallon USTs and one 675-gallon UST were decommissioned by removal from this site in February 2016.  A total of 178.80 tons of PCS were subsequently excavated from around the tanks and piping runs and shipped to the Hillsboro Landfill for disposal.  Residual contaminant concentrations in the soil and groundwater do not exceed DEQ RBCs for complete exposure pathways.",140669.0,0.0,KDANA,2017-05-18 15:08:54.253
