47172,26-16-0983,26,16,0983,10679.0,2016-07-28,2016-08-01 08:43:41.893,GI TRUCKING dba ESTES WEST,13704 NE AIRPORT WAY,PORTLAND,97230,,False,,,,,True,False,False,,False,False,False,False,False,"The diesel satellites were removed and the satellite piping was abandoned in place.
 
