2/9/17:Hi Ash,  

I need to clear up a couple of LUST numbers in the database.   First the numbers and their associated addresses:

26-16-0070: 314 NE 45th Ave

26-16-1074: 316 NE 45th Ave 

Our clients developed this property, splitting the original lot into 2 lots.   When we started the work and collected samples, the address was 314 NE 45th Ave.  We sampled well before they were ready for a cleanup, and the first file was opened.  When we continued the work, I mistakenly reported the release under the new address (316 NE 45th Ave), which is the address my clients started referring to.   

See the attached maps for reference.  The first is of the footprint for the original property and tank location.   The property was then demolished and 2 houses built on the newly separated lot.  I hope this makes sense!  It seems the release should be under 314 NE 45th Ave and that 316 should be administratively closed. Let me know what you think. 

Best, 
