47658,08-16-1469,08,16,1469,11862.0,2016-10-31,2016-11-03 11:07:40.557,HODGE DISTRIBUTOR INC,1360 Idaho Street,PORT ORFORD,97465,,False,7.0,,4.0,,True,False,False,,False,False,False,False,False,Contmaination in soils up to 6 feet deep.  Likely already in fill soil or stormwater runoff from fueling pad.  Concentrations are very low <35ppm.  Likely not a release from the UST system. No cleanup performed or needed.,,"On September 28, 2016, PBS Environmental collected soil and groundwater samples from five locations around the fueling pad. Diesel contamination was detected in soils on the north and west side of the fueling pad. Contamination appears to be confined to fill soils with organic and wood debris present. All groundwater samples were below detectable concentrations of gasoline or diesel. All soil samples are below the most stringent soil matrix cleanup standard.",31714.0,24926.0,CRICHAR,2017-01-18 09:40:22.530
