47958,20-17-0098,20,17,0098,,2017-02-06,2017-02-06 12:58:37.460,"Stewart, Mimi",2117 Olive St,EUGENE,97405,,False,2.0,,1.0,,False,True,False,,False,False,False,False,False,"Jim Kooiman emailed the reported release on 2/1/17.
