47961,26-17-0101,26,17,0101,1890.0,2017-02-03,2017-02-07 12:32:20.990,Ross Island Sand & Gravel Vanport Plant,1835 N Marine Drive,PORTLAND,97217,,False,7.0,,4.0,,True,False,False,,False,False,False,False,False,,,"A 10,000-gallon diesel UST was decommissioned in-place at this site in August 2017, while 18.5 tons of PCS were removed from along a product pipeline.  Confirmation soil sampling found no residual contamination.",145841.0,25238.0,KDANA,2017-12-28 12:38:48.140
