48081,33-17-0221,33,17,0221,,2017-03-09,2017-03-10 09:42:55.640,Orchard View Inc.,4055 SKYLINE RD,THE DALLES,97058,(541) 298-4496,False,,,,,False,False,True,,False,False,False,False,False,,,"Three single-wall fiberglass 1,000 gallon USTs were removed.  227 tons of petroleum contaminated soil was excavated and disposed of at Wasco County Landfill.  Contamination was left in place from 12 feet below ground surface to an estimated 30+ feet below ground surface. Diesel contamination remains in soil at detected concentrations of 21,200 mg/kg at 16 feet below ground surface.  Additional site investigation indicates soil contamination left in place is up to 18 feet thick.  Subsurface contamination extends to the The Dalles High Line Transmisson Line right-of-way that transits south of the contaminant source area.",111510.0,0.0,CKENNED,2019-08-01 09:52:38.523
