48251,17-17-0391,17,17,0391,2992.0,2017-04-12,2017-04-19 14:00:21.503,JOSEPHINE COUNTY HOSPITAL,714 NW A St / 715 NW Dimmick St,GRANTS PASS,97526,(541) 474-5464,False,1.0,,4.0,,True,False,False,,False,False,False,False,False,"Release report: Regulated tanks held and leaked Bunker fuel, thus the ""heating oil"" contaminant.
However, later site assessment did not identify heavy-range hydrocarbons (including Bunker C) as contaminants of concern.  

Site address originally reported as 715 NW Dimmick St.  More specific address is 714 NW A St.  Site address changed in LUST database to ""714 NW A St / 715 NW Dimmick St"" to maintain connection with UST facility address...   gdeck 10/24/19.","17-90-0037 Josephine Memorial Hospital
ECSI # 4726","The site consists of three buildings across the 1.53-acre tax lot, The Josephine County Health Services building, the Central Plant, and the former Josephine County Hospital A Street building. Three gasoline underground storage tanks (UST) were decommissioned and removed from the northern most alcove of the hospital building in April 2017. Excavation efforts removed 172 tons of petroleum-contaminated soil (PCS) and overburden from the excavation in 2017.     Additional delineation of soil contamination at the site found that residual petroleum range hydrocarbons in the soil remains beneath the alcove and the SE corner of the hospital building between 7.5 and 9 feet below ground surface. Due to remaining contaminant concentrations an Easement and Equitable Servitude document (attached) was recorded with Josephine County on the property on June 12, 2019.  The EES requires that the Contaminated Media Management Plan (CMMP) be followed for any subsurface work at the site, and requires that petroleum-contaminated soil in exceedance of DEQ risk-based concentrations for vapor intrusion into buildings be removed, or a vapor mitigation system be implemented at the site in the event of either new construction over the area of contamination or occupation of the existing structure occurs.",6991.0,0.0,ALEIDEL,2020-04-28 09:50:33.107
