48780,21-17-0920,21,17,0920,12546.0,2017-08-01,2017-08-07 14:21:38.320,Heringer Gas Station,5838 SE Highway 101,LINCOLN CITY,97367,Cell: N/A,False,1.0,,4.0,,True,False,False,,False,False,False,False,False,"This is an old nest of 5 tanks which used to serve a gasoline station. The tanks were removed and are 675 gallons or smaller.  They were abandoned with fuel remaining so impacts are to the floor of the pits as well as the walls.  I pumped all tanks to a Baker tank.  When each tank was removed, the excavation filled with water.  All five tanks have leaked.  All appears to be aged gasoline, but waiting for HCID; follow-up gx or dx.  This site is less than 300' of shoreline on Siletz Bay.  We expect to excavate next week.... Dana Thompson 8/1/2017

