During the drilling the regular fuel line was punctured in front of dispenser 4. I called Eric Clough on the morning of Thursday, November 16th to report that a spill had taken place. 
The contractor Lee Bennett was on location Monday, November 20th as well as members from GeoDesign to begin remediation of the contaminated soil as well as see what needed to be done to replace the compromised fuel line. 
