50853,06-19-0095,06,19,0095,,2019-01-24,2019-02-04 16:12:57.480,Goergen Property,SE corner of Date Ave & N Bayshore Dr,COOS BAY,97420,,False,1.0,,4.0,,True,False,False,,False,False,False,False,False,"RYS Environmental LLC;  rysenvllc@gmail.com;  Property has no address.  Tax Lot 3400 on Map #25S1326CA.  Discovery of tank was a surprise.  Tank and contaminated soil was removed.  Tank was located on property at SE corner of Date St. and N Bayshore Dr.

1/29/19 pit water sample 3000 Diesel & 11,000 gasoline range organics. PCS 633 mg/kg gasoline range organics. VOC & BTEX ND.",,"Prior to 1911, the site was a mud flat, which was built up with sand. Since that time the site has remained undeveloped except for a historic oil storage shed. The property has mainly been used for parking and temporary storage for the property to the east.Contamination is apparently the result of spills or leaks from the historic oil storage shed and an underground storage tank. In January 2019 about six tons of petroleum-contaminated soil was excavated and disposed of at the Coffin Butte Landfill while decommissioning the UST by removal. Soil and groundwater between six and nine feet below ground are impacted on the northern portion of the site and extending no more than about ten feet off-site to the north, beneath the Date Ave. right of way. An opportunity to comment on the proposed closure was given to surrounding property owners, utility providers, and the City of Coos Bay. No comments were received. As a condition of closure, an Easement and Equitable Servitudes document was recorded on the property on October 25, 2019. The EES prohibits the property from being used for any type of residential purpose and it requires that an approved Contaminated Media Management Plan (dated June 18, 2019) be followed for any subsurface construction. This investigation focused solely on the northwestern portion of the property in the vicinity of the former underground storage tank and did not attempt to identify any other potential sources of contamination on the on the remainder of the property.",153628.0,28245.0,CRICHAR,2020-01-14 10:24:22.207
