51292,34-19-0534,34,19,0534,,2019-06-05,2019-06-11 14:12:08.310,Visitation Parish,4189 NW Visitation Rd,FOREST GROVE,97116,,False,,,,,False,True,False,,False,False,False,False,False,"PBS Engineering & Environmental Inc.;  matt.randall@pbsusa.com;  The tank was located approx. 2 feet near the NW corner of the school gym. Product lines ran approximately 70 ft N & 15 feet S. The tank was 4x12 with ~300-gal of product removed. Removal revealed heavy corrosion in the base of the tank with visible holes and staining seen beneath the tank. Approx. 35 cubic yards of stained soil was removed. Confirmation samples were collected to the W and N of the tank pit, but the gym to the SE prevented further removal of stained soil. No GW was encountered, however, water perched above the native silt seeped into the hole from back-filled rock beneath the pavement surface.",,,144445.0,28738.0,CSALNAV,2019-06-13 16:20:36.767
