52070,24-20-0069,24,20,0069,305.0,2020-01-16,2020-01-23 17:26:25.583,Former Bellinger Auto,210 Capitol St NE,SALEM,97301,,False,1.0,,4.0,,True,False,False,,False,False,False,False,False,"Anderson Geological, Inc.;  erik@andersongeo.com;  The RP would like to enroll in the Cost Recovery program ASAP. Please send the application to him at his email address...1/16/2020

3 USTs discovered and registered 1/2020 at this previously closed UST Facility.  Not an active system release...gdeck","LUST 24-62-4001 Union 4332-I
LUST 24-75-4001 Union 4332-II
LUST 24-87-4009 Bellinger Bros.
LUST 24-92-4115 Ole's Auto Service
ECSI # 716 B & B Properties","The site operated as service station from 1957 to 1987 and a fueling station greases shop before 1957. DEQ issued a NFA to this site in Nov 2011 after petroleum USTs related to 1957-1987 station were remove. A waste oil UST also associated with these operations was decommissioned in place (refer to LUST 24-87-4009). Three abandoned USTs related to the pre-1957 fueling station were found during a Phase II ESA  in December 2019. The USTs, the Waste Oil tank that was left in place and 101 tons of PCS were removed. 

Petroleum contamiantion in soil and groundwater related to the former USTs and fueling operations remains beneath the site. DEQ determined that this contamiantion does not pose an unacceptable risk to current or future site uses of the site with the implementation of the following conditions on the property: 1) groundwater on the site is not used, 2) a Contaminated Media Management Plan and worker Health and Safety Plan is implemented during any subsurface work on the site, and 3) no redevelopmnet or building expansion is completed on the site without DEQ approval and appropriate vapor mitigation measures.

The conditions above were implemented through a deed restriction recorded on the property with Marion County in May 18, 2020.  DEQ plans to issue a conditional NFA in June 2020 following completion of a public comment period.",6927.0,29535.0,NSAWKA,2020-05-27 17:15:11.837
