52517,24-20-0514,24,20,0514,,2020-06-23,2020-06-23 11:08:18.950,"Muis, Robert C.",6291 Ogle St SE,SALEM,97317,503-999-0790,False,7.0,,,,False,False,True,,False,False,False,False,False,"7/22/2020 J.Claussen: Spoke w/Bill Goff. Discovered two tanks on property; one was split tank with diesel and old diesel, sampling at 210ppb diesel, PCS disposed. Second tank was HOT approx. 20' from farm house and had leaked. Tank also decommissioned and PCS removed. Will submit one closure report to address both tanks.

Bill Goff Construction;  goff1@pacifier.com;  This was a 2 compartment tank.  HCID was run with a hit for Heavy Oil, we then run a DX which came back 210 ppm for Heavy oil..
We feel this was a Farm Tank due to the farm acreage at the site.",,"Owner discovered two tanks on property; one was believed to be an old farm tank due to farm acreage at site.  The farm tank was a 2-compartment underground storage tank with diesel/heavy oil.  Samples indicated 210ppb diesel at heavy end, Second tank was undergound heating oil tank, approx. 20' from farm house.  Soil samples beneath tank revealed a leak with 44,700ppm diesel in soil at approx 8-9 feet below ground surface. Both tanks were decommissioned and removed along with overexcavation of impacted soil.  Approx. 6 tons of soil taken to Coffin Butte.  Confirmation samples were nondetect.  Report dated 10/14/20",161547.0,30025.0,AFARRIS,2021-03-29 10:57:45.897
