53023,20-20-1020,20,20,1020,12650.0,2020-10-23,2020-11-06 14:33:46.163,Industrial Property,3490 Industrial Ave,SPRINGFIELD,97478,,False,,,,,True,False,False,,False,False,False,False,False,"BB&A Environmental;  jakooiman@bbaenv.com;  A 10,000 gallon diesel UST and a 2,000 gallon gasoline UST were removed on 10/14/2020. Both tanks were in very good condition.  Water was observed in the excavation.  The excavation was pumped.  Groundwater returned to the excavation and was analyzed using NWTPH-HCID. No TPH is excess of lab reporting limits was detected. Soil samples were collected from beneath the UST, from the sidewalls of the excavation as the soil/water interface, and from beneath the dispenser island.  The presence of diesel- and oil-range TPH was detected in 3 samples using NWTPH-HCID. Quantification of the 3 samples using NWTPH-Dx is pending.",,,162448.0,30484.0,GDECK,2020-11-06 14:52:37.190
