53357,02-21-0199,02,21,0199,,2021-02-25,2021-03-09 15:27:35.123,Autumn Peterson Ag Prop,6154 Bellfountain Rd,CORVALLIS,97333,(503) 929-2724,False,,,,,False,False,True,,False,False,False,False,False,"BB&A Environmental;  jakooiman@bbaenv.com;  A 300-gallon gasoline UST and a 300-gallon diesel UST were decommissioned on February 25, 2021.  Both unregulated agricultural fuel tanks were located within the same excavation.  Obvious gasoline odor was encountered. Groundwater entered the excavation. Soil samples were collected from beneath each end of each tank. A groundwater sample was collected from a small sump excavated in the bottom of the pit.  All samples will initially be analyzed using NWTPH-HCID. The tanks were cleaned and scrapped. The excavation was backfilled with 3/4-inch minus gravel. This reports serves as notification that groundwater was encountered at the site.",,,164118.0,30854.0,GDECK,2021-03-09 15:45:38.927
