53813,36-21-0655,36,21,0655,,2021-07-07,2021-07-09 08:45:33.767,"Stockwell, Caryn",582 NE D St,WILLAMINA,97396,360-798-6584,False,0.0,,0.0,,False,True,False,0.0,False,False,False,False,False,Bill Goff Construction;  goff1@pacifier.com;  Caryn Stockwell bought the home several years earlier with an abandoned heating oil tank 275 gallon AST.  The oil furnace had been disconnected & disabled from the AST.    She decided to have  a new electric furnace be installed.   She called Bill Goff for help in removing & decommissioning the AST.    Bill Goff removed & decommissioned the AST.   When the AST was moved away from the home a vertical pipe was found behind the AST.  The pipe was checked & an underground abandoned UST was found.   Bill Goff decommissioned the tank & soil samples revealed it leaked.   Previous owner claimed she knew nothing of the tank.,,,,31377.0,MCOBB,2021-07-09 08:45:33.767
